.gov.jo/wps/portal/Home/GovernmentEntities/Ministries/MinistryServiceDetails_ar/ministry%20of%20industry%20and%20trade/services/registering%20trade%20names?lang=ar","accessed":"2026-10-09","note":"Read through a search index because the portal blocks direct fetches: 10 JOD name search, 20 JOD registration, MIT hours and address. Re-check on the page."},"S5":{"id":"S5","title":{"en":"Jordan e-Government portal: registering a sole proprietorship (MIT)","ar":"بوابة الحكومة الإلكترونية: تسجيل مؤسسة فردية"},"url":"https://portal.jordan.gov.jo/wps/portal/Home/GovernmentEntities/Ministries/MinistryServiceDetails_ar/ministry%20of%20industry%20and%20trade/services/individual%20institutions%20registration?lang=ar","accessed":"2026-10-09","note":"Registration fee 10-40 JOD by capital plus 5 JOD certificate. Matches S1."},"S6":{"id":"S6","title":{"en":"JFDA statement on licensing home food preparation (Al-Mamlaka TV, 19 May 2026)","ar":"المؤسسة العامة للغذاء والدواء حول ترخيص إعداد الغذاء من المنزل (قناة المملكة، 19 أيار 2026)"},"url":"https://www.almamlakatv.com/news/199806-","accessed":"2026-10-09","note":"2024 instructions; documents: commercial register, zoning plan or lease, ID; inspection and lab samples; hotline 117114."},"S7":{"id":"S7","title":{"en":"ISTD guide to electronic services 2024","ar":"دائرة ضريبة الدخل والمبيعات: الدليل الإرشادي للخدمات الإلكترونية 2024"},"url":"https://www.istd.gov.jo/ebv4.0/root_storage/en/eb_list_page/guide_for_electronic_services_2024.pdf","accessed":"2026-10-09","note":"First-time tax number registration is an online service."},"S8":{"id":"S8","title":{"en":"MIT eRegulations investor guide: register a home-based food business (rented home)","ar":"دليل المستثمر الإلكتروني لوزارة الصناعة والتجارة: تسجيل مشروع منزلي لتصنيع الغذاء (منزل مستأجر)"},"url":"https://jordan.eregulations.org/procedure/54?l=en","accessed":"2026-10-09","note":"Official step-by-step procedure with offices, documents, fees and times: trader registration, Chamber of In